@startuml
title ** Transfer Bonus Expired Auto Cancel **
participant BonusService as bs
participant TpService as ts
database Siebog as db
participant 第三方 as tp


bs -> db: 取得過期紅利且注單皆已結算 Service_TransferBonusExpired_Get
db -> bs:
bs -> bs: 計算退回本金
bs -> bs: 計算剩餘 Bonus
alt 剩餘 Bonus 大於0
    bs -> ts: [BonusCancelTransfer]
    ts -> db: 驗證轉帳單號是否在處理中 Service_TpTransferInfo_Bonus_Get
    note right 
    TpTransferInfo
    end note
    db -> ts:
    alt 轉帳處理中
        ts -> bs: Transfer Processing.
    end
        ts -> tp: 取餘額 [GetBalance]
        tp -> ts:
        ts -> ts: 檢查第三方剩餘金額並判斷是否需要修改 Bonus Amount
        ts -> db: 紀錄轉帳單號 Service_TpTransferInfo_Ins
        ts -> tp: 餘額從第三方轉回主錢包 [Transfer]
        tp -> ts:
        alt 轉回成功
            ts -> db: 更新轉帳狀態 TpTransferInfo_Set
            ts -> db: 取消紅利 Service_BonusExpired_Set
            ts -> db: 更新主錢包餘額 Wallet_Set
            alt 退回本金 > 0
            ts -> db: 加回提款限額 Common_WithdrawalLimit_Set
            end
        end
        ts -> bs:
end
alt 剩餘 Bonus 等於0
    bs -> db: 取消紅利 Service_BonusExpired_Set
end
@enduml